Vendored, loaded lazily by the progress panel (the boxes may have no internet, so no CDN at runtime).
mermaid.min.js  mermaid 11.4.1 (MIT, see mermaid.LICENSE), copied from the npm package's dist/ directory.
To update: install the new version somewhere outside this repo, copy dist/mermaid.min.js and LICENSE, change the version above.

Also vendored, one level up in public/ (ES modules, loaded by the terminal):
xterm.mjs            @xterm/xterm 6.0.0, lib/xterm.mjs
addon-fit.mjs        @xterm/addon-fit 0.11.0, lib/addon-fit.mjs
addon-unicode11.mjs  @xterm/addon-unicode11 0.9.0, lib/addon-unicode11.mjs
xterm.css, xterm.LICENSE   @xterm/xterm 6.0.0, css/xterm.css and LICENSE
All are unmodified copies from the npm packages; the only difference is that the trailing "//# sourceMappingURL=..." comment line was removed from the .mjs files.
To re-verify: npm pack the package at that version in a scratch directory, extract, and diff against the file here.

